{#-
  The ask for a field's suggestion (suggestions/field.ts): the page as it stands, which is the long
  context, so it comes first; then the field clicked into and what's written in it; then the ask,
  last. Takes a SetupView (page), a FieldView (field) and how much to suggest (length).
-#}
{% from "partials/setup.njk" import setup %}
{{ setup(page) }}

<field>
Where: {{ field.where }}
What it holds: {{ field.holds }}
</field>

<written>
{% if field.text %}
{{ field.text }}
{% else %}
(nothing yet)
{% endif %}
</written>

Suggest what comes next in this field: {{ length }}. Answer with only the words to add.
